1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:53,080 --> 00:01:54,670
The rank 1000 Demon Spirit Crystal

25
00:01:55,040 --> 00:01:57,720
Rank 1000\NDemon Spirit Crystal

26
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,390
can be converted into celestial spiritual energy.

27
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,150
But even if I add all the celestial jades I have,

28
00:02:00,960 --> 00:02:03,350
it would barely be enough to reach Late stage Soul Transformation.

29
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:08,630
Halt, intruder !

30
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:14,430
I have important matters to discuss with your Commander Wang.

31
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:16,200
The Ancestor is in seclusion,

32
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,480
please come back later.

33
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:25,360
Fellow cultivator Yao, barging in rudely like this

34
00:02:25,520 --> 00:02:27,230
isn't very polite.

35
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:29,870
Sorry for being rude.

36
00:02:30,720 --> 00:02:32,510
I hope fellow cultivator Wang will forgive me

37
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:35,110
but I really have an urgent request.

38
00:02:35,720 --> 00:02:36,910
If it's not worth my time,

39
00:02:37,120 --> 00:02:38,840
then don't blame me for being impolite too.

40
00:02:49,760 --> 00:02:50,750
Fellow cultivator Wang,

41
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,830
this matter is extremely confidential

42
00:02:53,280 --> 00:02:54,750
so I need to be on guard.

43
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,110
I hope you don't mind.

44
00:02:56,920 --> 00:02:58,430
This whole Demon Spirit Land

45
00:02:58,440 --> 00:03:00,630
used to be the cultivation cave of a Celestial.

46
00:03:01,080 --> 00:03:02,840
After the collapse of the Celestial Realm,

47
00:03:02,880 --> 00:03:04,230
it stopped being used.

48
00:03:04,560 --> 00:03:07,160
I accidentally found a path to that celestial cave

49
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:10,510
but I can't break the restrictions outside it alone.

50
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:13,550
I heard fellow cultivator Wang is skilled in restrictions.

51
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,510
If we successfully enter,

52
00:03:15,960 --> 00:03:18,950
we will split the celestial artifacts inside equally between us.

53
00:03:19,360 --> 00:03:20,310
What do you think ?

54
00:03:21,160 --> 00:03:22,950
A celestial cave is indeed worth exploring.

55
00:03:23,760 --> 00:03:25,270
But this person isn't trustworthy.

56
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:27,230
I need to inquire a bit more...

57
00:03:27,960 --> 00:03:29,830
I'm at a critical point in my cultivation.

58
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,630
I can't help you.

59
00:03:32,320 --> 00:03:33,110
I'm sorry.

60
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,950
I presume fellow cultivator Wang is trying to breakthrough to Late stage

61
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:40,470
but doesn't have enough celestial jades.

62
00:03:40,840 --> 00:03:42,070
To show my sincerity,

63
00:03:42,240 --> 00:03:43,710
I am willing to provide fellow cultivator Wang

64
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:46,630
with enough celestial jades to reach Early stage Ascendant.

65
00:03:47,240 --> 00:03:48,430
This is the deposit,

66
00:03:48,840 --> 00:03:51,680
it should be enough to help you reach Late stage Soul Transformation.

67
00:03:52,040 --> 00:03:53,630
I will give you the rest

68
00:03:53,720 --> 00:03:54,630
if we

69
00:03:54,880 --> 00:03:57,070
succeed in entering the cave.

70
00:03:57,680 --> 00:03:59,600
As expected of the Blood Ancestor's daughter...

71
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:00,910
She really is extravagant.

72
00:04:01,960 --> 00:04:03,070
This is too dangerous,

73
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:05,560
I'm sorry but I'm not willing to take the risk.

74
00:04:07,960 --> 00:04:10,070
If fellow cultivator Wang is worried about safety,

75
00:04:10,440 --> 00:04:12,110
you can take this Blood Soul Pill.

76
00:04:12,640 --> 00:04:13,910
It will ensure your safety.

77
00:04:14,480 --> 00:04:15,630
A Blood Soul Pill !?

78
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:18,320
This pill is refined by the Blood Ancestor's secret technique.

79
00:04:18,320 --> 00:04:20,110
I've heard that even your body is completely destroyed

80
00:04:20,120 --> 00:04:21,270
and your Origin Soul crushed,

81
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:24,070
you can still use this pill to reconstruct them

82
00:04:24,560 --> 00:04:26,280
and be completely unharmed.

83
00:04:26,840 --> 00:04:28,800
If I obtain such a life-saving treasure,

84
00:04:28,840 --> 00:04:30,510
I would be able to escape deadly situations.

85
00:04:31,920 --> 00:04:34,510
I've heard of this, it's the Blood Planet's treasure...

86
00:04:35,040 --> 00:04:37,230
How is this pill used ?

87
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,310
This is my Yao Family's secret,

88
00:04:39,440 --> 00:04:41,070
I can't reveal it so easily

89
00:04:42,480 --> 00:04:45,710
unless... you agree to come with me.

90
00:04:46,120 --> 00:04:48,150
I'll even give you one more

91
00:04:48,440 --> 00:04:49,630
as payment.

92
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,710
Agreed.

93
00:04:54,440 --> 00:04:55,870
Use the method in this jade

94
00:04:56,040 --> 00:04:57,950
to leave a mark on the Blood Soul Pill.

95
00:04:58,440 --> 00:05:00,910
It will link your body and Origin Soul to the pill

96
00:05:01,320 --> 00:05:04,470
to allow you to reconstruct your body and soul.

97
00:05:05,520 --> 00:05:06,590
Let's meet in 3 days

98
00:05:06,880 --> 00:05:09,150
at the hour the purple demon rises

99
00:05:09,880 --> 00:05:11,270
on top of Drum Mountain.

100
00:05:14,720 --> 00:05:16,030
When I hold this pill,

101
00:05:16,840 --> 00:05:19,030
it feels like we share the same blood.

102
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:35,240
3 days later

103
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,480
I'm going out for a bit.

104
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:41,480
While I'm away,

105
00:05:42,080 --> 00:05:44,400
you two will stay in the Black Armor Barracks and wait for me.

106
00:05:44,560 --> 00:05:45,830
Remember to cultivate.

107
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:47,030
Understood !

108
00:05:48,800 --> 00:05:51,640
Drum Mountain\NDemon Spirit Land

109
00:05:54,040 --> 00:05:55,910
I've given him enough celestial jades

110
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,710
but after 3 days

111
00:05:57,720 --> 00:05:59,950
he still hasn't reached Late stage Soul Transformation.

112
00:06:00,640 --> 00:06:02,710
It seems he isn't very talented.

113
00:06:03,760 --> 00:06:06,030
When the purple demon reaches its peak,

114
00:06:06,840 --> 00:06:09,350
a ray of blood-colored light will come from the compass.

115
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:11,030
Follow me closely.

116
00:06:16,000 --> 00:06:18,440
Celestial Qing Lin's cave\NDemon Spirit Land

117
00:06:17,440 --> 00:06:18,880
Focus your mind and sit here,

118
00:06:18,880 --> 00:06:20,270
concentrate on your domain.

119
00:06:20,840 --> 00:06:22,510
Once recognized by the golden symbol,

120
00:06:22,760 --> 00:06:24,630
we will walk the Revered Dragon Path.

121
00:06:33,040 --> 00:06:34,800
The golden energy entered her body ?

122
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,430
Your turn now.

123
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:38,230
Yao Xixue's body

124
00:06:38,480 --> 00:06:40,630
now gives off the pressure of a Celestial.

125
00:07:05,840 --> 00:07:07,670
I only got a 3-strokes golden symbol.

126
00:07:08,440 --> 00:07:10,230
He actually obtained at least 6 !

127
00:07:10,840 --> 00:07:12,870
Could it be that his domain is superior to mine ?

128
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,750
How is that possible ?

129
00:07:20,880 --> 00:07:21,670
Let's go.

130
00:07:22,560 --> 00:07:24,710
Yao Xixue is very familiar with this place,

131
00:07:25,360 --> 00:07:27,150
it's clearly not her first time entering.

132
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,630
As the Blood Ancestor's beloved daughter,

133
00:07:29,960 --> 00:07:32,080
she should have all the celestial artifacts she needs.

134
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:33,870
Why does she risk coming here ?

135
00:07:33,200 --> 00:07:36,400
First platform\NRevered Dragon Path

136
00:07:34,840 --> 00:07:36,840
Her obsession with this celestial cave

137
00:07:36,840 --> 00:07:39,160
must be because of the Blood Ancestor's orders.

138
00:07:39,640 --> 00:07:41,030
She must have other objectives.

139
00:07:42,520 --> 00:07:44,470
This place has 12 layers of restrictions,

140
00:07:44,640 --> 00:07:46,350
we will take turns breaking them.

141
00:07:46,720 --> 00:07:48,830
I'll take the first layer.

142
00:07:53,680 --> 00:07:54,470
Seal !

143
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:57,310
This statue's cultivation is no less than Soul Transformation.

144
00:07:58,160 --> 00:08:00,880
Can Yao Xixue seal it so easily ?

145
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:08,030
Artifacts from the Blood Planet really are something...

146
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:13,030
This is...

147
00:08:14,440 --> 00:08:15,430
A golden symbol ?

148
00:08:15,880 --> 00:08:17,710
The golden symbol in the statue

149
00:08:17,840 --> 00:08:20,230
is almost identical to the one I just gained from my domain.

150
00:08:21,040 --> 00:08:24,070
Could it be that these golden symbols made of celestial spiritual energy

151
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:26,030
were sealed inside the statues ?

152
00:08:31,120 --> 00:08:32,510
If that's true,

153
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:35,510
these 12 layers of restrictions aren't obstacles

154
00:08:36,440 --> 00:08:38,470
but an incredible opportunity !

155
00:08:44,600 --> 00:08:47,800
Second platform\NRevered Dragon Path

156
00:09:01,640 --> 00:09:03,150
If it's really made of restrictions

157
00:09:04,360 --> 00:09:06,110
then there must be a way to lift them !

158
00:09:16,760 --> 00:09:19,510
With his skill in restrictions, he should be able to break it directly.

159
00:09:19,960 --> 00:09:21,670
Why is he fighting with the statue ?

160
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:29,990
As I thought.

161
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,270
This is the restriction's core.

162
00:09:37,520 --> 00:09:38,230
Release !

163
00:09:51,960 --> 00:09:54,280
Why is there a golden symbol inside the statue !?

164
00:10:04,120 --> 00:10:05,230
This golden symbol

165
00:10:05,640 --> 00:10:08,350
seems to have one more stroke than the one on the first platform.

166
00:10:12,920 --> 00:10:14,310
It was an accident.

167
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:15,950
He just got lucky, that's all.

168
00:10:18,160 --> 00:10:20,840
Third platform\NRevered Dragon Path

169
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,510
I just need to smash the statue,

170
00:10:19,920 --> 00:10:21,030
what's so difficult about it ?

171
00:10:24,560 --> 00:10:26,270
This time it has 3 strokes.

172
00:10:32,560 --> 00:10:34,310
How exactly did I fail ?

173
00:10:34,640 --> 00:10:36,230
Why aren't there any golden symbols !?

174
00:10:36,680 --> 00:10:39,400
Fourth platform\NRevered Dragon Path

175
00:10:42,040 --> 00:10:43,840
A 4-strokes golden symbol...

176
00:10:44,360 --> 00:10:45,230
As I thought.

177
00:10:45,440 --> 00:10:47,760
Fifth platform\NRevered Dragon Path

178
00:10:49,760 --> 00:10:51,470
How exactly did he do it ?

179
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:58,360
Sixth platform\NRevered Dragon Path

180
00:10:59,360 --> 00:11:00,000
Seventh platform\NRevered Dragon Path

181
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:01,280
Eighth platform\NRevered Dragon Path

182
00:11:01,280 --> 00:11:01,720
Ninth platform\NRevered Dragon Path

183
00:11:01,720 --> 00:11:02,120
Tenth platform\NRevered Dragon Path

184
00:11:02,120 --> 00:11:02,760
Eleventh platform\NRevered Dragon Path

185
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,230
This is the last one,

186
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:14,150
a 12-strokes golden symbol...

187
00:11:20,080 --> 00:11:20,870
This is...

188
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:22,950
the character 'Lin' ?

189
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:26,150
I am Qing Lin.

190
00:11:26,800 --> 00:11:29,670
It seems the former owner of this cave was named Qing Lin.

191
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:34,200
Something's wrong...

192
00:11:34,640 --> 00:11:35,830
These 12 layers of restrictions...

193
00:11:36,080 --> 00:11:37,910
kept increasing in difficulty.

194
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:40,270
But with Yao Xixue's strength,

195
00:11:40,640 --> 00:11:43,520
she could easily pass through just by using her artifacts.

196
00:11:44,320 --> 00:11:46,470
Why did she insist on inviting me then ?

197
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,950
The restriction statues aren't the final challenge.

198
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:51,800
This place...

199
00:11:52,800 --> 00:11:54,230
has other dangers.

200
00:12:15,880 --> 00:12:17,680
Ferocious wind blocks the path.

201
00:12:19,160 --> 00:12:20,470
We have no way back.

202
00:12:21,640 --> 00:12:22,830
If you can survive 3 strikes,

203
00:12:23,160 --> 00:12:25,030
you qualify to enter the cave.

204
00:12:26,520 --> 00:12:28,350
We'll each take a strike,

205
00:12:28,640 --> 00:12:30,510
and survive the last one together.

206
00:12:31,080 --> 00:12:31,910
Gentleman,

207
00:12:32,760 --> 00:12:33,590
you're first.

208
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:35,030
Step forward now.

209
00:12:35,640 --> 00:12:36,430
Fellow cultivator Wang,

210
00:12:36,880 --> 00:12:37,630
please.

211
00:12:38,240 --> 00:12:39,510
And if I refuse ?

212
00:12:40,560 --> 00:12:41,950
As you can see,

213
00:12:42,080 --> 00:12:43,470
the way back is blocked.

214
00:12:43,840 --> 00:12:46,830
All who have obtained a golden symbol

215
00:12:47,160 --> 00:12:49,750
must enter the celestial cave in order to survive.

216
00:12:51,320 --> 00:12:52,110
So...

217
00:12:52,960 --> 00:12:55,030
inviting me to break restrictions was just a pretense.

218
00:12:55,960 --> 00:12:58,030
The real reason was to have me take the strikes for you ?

219
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:01,550
We just need to withstand these 3 Ascendant level sword strikes together

220
00:13:02,080 --> 00:13:04,230
and we can enter the celestial cave.

221
00:13:04,440 --> 00:13:05,670
Fellow cultivator Yao flatters me.

222
00:13:06,680 --> 00:13:08,470
I'm only at Middle stage Soul Transformation,

223
00:13:09,240 --> 00:13:11,510
how can I withstand Ascendant level sword strikes ?

224
00:13:13,160 --> 00:13:14,030
Wang Lin,

225
00:13:14,440 --> 00:13:16,230
blocking the strikes with me

226
00:13:16,240 --> 00:13:17,950
is your only path to survival.

227
00:13:18,360 --> 00:13:19,550
Succeed and live

228
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:21,230
or fail and die.

229
00:13:21,560 --> 00:13:22,110
You...

230
00:13:22,440 --> 00:13:23,830
have no choice.

231
00:13:25,640 --> 00:13:26,630
Don't worry,

232
00:13:27,080 --> 00:13:29,870
didn't you already take the Blood Soul Pill ?

233
00:13:30,040 --> 00:13:31,830
Fellow cultivator Yao is quite the schemer.

234
00:13:33,640 --> 00:13:35,230
Likewise.

235
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:37,030
I hope you will

236
00:13:37,640 --> 00:13:39,030
keep your promise.

237
00:13:46,560 --> 00:13:48,830
With your Middle stage Soul Transformation cultivation,

238
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:50,630
taking a sword strike

239
00:13:50,640 --> 00:13:52,110
won't necessarily kill you.

240
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,630
Use the Blood Soul Pill's spell now !

241
00:13:59,640 --> 00:14:01,310
You must survive fellow cultivator Wang !

242
00:14:04,200 --> 00:14:06,910
But if you took the fake pill I gave you...

243
00:14:07,520 --> 00:14:09,430
you will die for sure...

244
00:14:11,440 --> 00:14:13,030
The location of this celestial cave

245
00:14:13,040 --> 00:14:14,870
is the ultimate secret of my Yao Family.

246
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:17,750
How could I let you leave alive ?

247
00:14:18,680 --> 00:14:19,670
Wang Lin,

248
00:14:20,320 --> 00:14:23,230
it should be an honor to sacrifice yourself

249
00:14:23,640 --> 00:14:25,430
for the Yao Family.

250
00:14:27,160 --> 00:14:28,070
The first strike

251
00:14:28,440 --> 00:14:29,830
can be considered blocked.

252
00:14:30,640 --> 00:14:31,670
Are you ready

253
00:14:32,120 --> 00:14:33,670
for the second strike ?

254
00:14:34,680 --> 00:14:35,470
Bring it on !

255
00:14:37,040 --> 00:14:38,670
I entered this place several times.

256
00:14:38,880 --> 00:14:39,830
The statue restrictions

257
00:14:39,840 --> 00:14:41,310
can be passed using artifacts.

258
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:43,150
But for these 3 sword strikes,

259
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:45,510
I could only block the first 2.

260
00:14:46,160 --> 00:14:48,150
Now that Wang Lin blocked one for me,

261
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:50,150
I'm sure I can win.

262
00:14:52,520 --> 00:14:54,070
The final strike.

263
00:15:06,760 --> 00:15:07,670
Father...

264
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:10,200
I didn't fail to meet your expectations !

265
00:15:10,240 --> 00:15:11,430
I did it !

266
00:15:12,120 --> 00:15:13,480
The Yao Family

267
00:15:14,000 --> 00:15:15,670
might finally ascend !

268
00:15:15,840 --> 00:15:17,070
Thank you fellow cultivator Yao,

269
00:15:17,760 --> 00:15:19,550
for blocking 2 strikes for me.

270
00:15:19,720 --> 00:15:20,870
You're still alive !?

271
00:15:21,040 --> 00:15:22,390
I suspected all along

272
00:15:22,760 --> 00:15:24,830
that the Blood Soul Pill you gave me was fake.

273
00:15:25,640 --> 00:15:27,150
How could you have given

274
00:15:28,080 --> 00:15:30,560
such a precious treasure to me so easily ?

275
00:15:31,680 --> 00:15:34,430
And you were so concerned about my safety

276
00:15:35,040 --> 00:15:36,470
that you used your Divine Sense

277
00:15:36,800 --> 00:15:38,950
to ensure I took the pill.

278
00:15:39,880 --> 00:15:41,310
If the pill was fake,

279
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:43,830
then the celestial cave was most likely real.

280
00:15:44,360 --> 00:15:47,510
So I didn't use the celestial jades you gave me to breakthrough.

281
00:15:47,960 --> 00:15:51,160
Instead, I converted them into a celestial crystal and stored it within my body

282
00:15:51,160 --> 00:15:52,870
to use it to save my life.

283
00:15:53,360 --> 00:15:56,720
So you used this celestial crystal to withstand the Ascendant sword strike

284
00:15:56,720 --> 00:15:58,870
and then used the impact to pretend falling in the abyss.

285
00:15:59,120 --> 00:16:00,510
Then you waited for me to withstand 2 strikes

286
00:16:00,560 --> 00:16:01,710
and be weakened

287
00:16:02,040 --> 00:16:03,470
to strike back...

288
00:16:03,960 --> 00:16:05,550
Zhou Wutai told me

289
00:16:05,920 --> 00:16:09,870
that the true use of the straw hat is to conceal your aura.

290
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:12,230
Don't waste your energy,

291
00:16:13,040 --> 00:16:14,750
I've already sealed your meridians.

292
00:16:15,240 --> 00:16:16,430
Right now, you...

293
00:16:16,760 --> 00:16:18,950
can't even use celestial spiritual energy.

294
00:16:19,640 --> 00:16:20,470
Wang Lin !

295
00:16:21,200 --> 00:16:22,710
You can just kill me !

296
00:16:22,760 --> 00:16:23,550
Kill you ?

297
00:16:24,040 --> 00:16:26,070
I'm sure you took a Blood Soul Pill.

298
00:16:26,680 --> 00:16:29,840
Killing you would just let you return to some blood formation.

299
00:16:30,160 --> 00:16:32,830
But if I use my Life and Death Domain to imprison you,

300
00:16:33,080 --> 00:16:34,310
it won't kill you

301
00:16:34,640 --> 00:16:37,510
and your Blood Soul Pill becomes completely useless...

302
00:16:37,600 --> 00:16:38,230
You !

303
00:16:44,360 --> 00:16:46,030
This woman laid a death trap for me

304
00:16:46,560 --> 00:16:49,430
by using these Ascendant level sword strikes

305
00:16:50,040 --> 00:16:51,870
and the fake Blood Soul Pill.

306
00:16:52,360 --> 00:16:54,510
What kind of celestial treasure is in this cave

307
00:16:54,880 --> 00:16:57,310
to make her go though so much effort ?

308
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,910
The remnant soul of the celestial cave

309
00:17:00,480 --> 00:17:02,430
welcomes Master.

310
00:17:10,520 --> 00:17:12,230
This is the celestial cave token.

311
00:17:12,760 --> 00:17:15,630
Holding this token allows free entry and exit from the cave.

312
00:17:16,520 --> 00:17:17,430
Master,

313
00:17:18,160 --> 00:17:19,470
please enter the cave.

314
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:24,910
This token is almost identical

315
00:17:24,920 --> 00:17:26,430
to the one I saw in the Tide Abyss...

316
00:17:28,120 --> 00:17:29,670
Master of this celestial cave ?

317
00:17:31,080 --> 00:17:32,030
No wonder.

318
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:38,040
Inside Qing Lin's Celestial Cave\NDemon Spirit Land

319
00:17:36,920 --> 00:17:39,320
It's similar to palaces of the Celestial Realm...

320
00:17:39,960 --> 00:17:41,910
It's entirely made of celestial jades...

321
00:17:47,240 --> 00:17:49,160
The restrictions here operate both as a whole

322
00:17:49,160 --> 00:17:50,150
and individually.

323
00:17:51,320 --> 00:17:53,110
It must be legendary celestial restrictions...

324
00:17:54,520 --> 00:17:55,950
With my current knowledge,

325
00:17:56,640 --> 00:17:58,710
I can't see through any of them.

326
00:18:06,560 --> 00:18:10,030
It seems there was another Master of this place before me.

327
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,670
This technique...

328
00:18:13,240 --> 00:18:16,720
Could it be the 18 Plum Blossom Restriction from the ancient cultivation world !?

329
00:18:29,240 --> 00:18:31,790
Although my predecessor already drank most of the wine,

330
00:18:32,400 --> 00:18:33,830
there are still 10 drops left.

331
00:18:34,680 --> 00:18:36,030
This celestial wine

332
00:18:36,760 --> 00:18:38,230
is definitely no ordinary thing.

333
00:18:47,480 --> 00:18:48,910
The celestial wine is mellow...

334
00:18:49,480 --> 00:18:51,230
It can even intoxicate the Origin Soul...

335
00:18:52,280 --> 00:18:53,630
At the time, I didn't expect

336
00:18:54,400 --> 00:18:55,550
that this intoxication

337
00:18:56,680 --> 00:18:58,430
would last a full year.

338
00:19:02,500 --> 00:21:07,160
Time passed by. Wang Lin continued to cultivate at the Black Armor Barracks. After absorbing the demonic spiritual energy of more than 500 demon soldiers and Regiment Leader Sun, the demon crystal in his body broke past rank 1000 when he finally fused them all.\N\NAbsorbing demonic spiritual energy with a rank 1000 plus demon crystal was several times faster than before.\N\NWang Lin didn’t care about any of the matters in the military camp. He spent all his time absorbing demonic spiritual energy to prepare for breaking into the late stage of Soul Transformation.

339
00:19:08,190 --> 00:19:13,830
I've been walking this path for endless years

340
00:19:10,490 --> 00:19:13,830
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

341
00:19:14,470 --> 00:19:19,430
Is it the compass of fate

342
00:19:16,310 --> 00:19:19,430
that wrote this outcome for us ?

343
00:19:19,590 --> 00:19:25,350
The heavens want to erase your existence,

344
00:19:25,470 --> 00:19:31,070
that's the obsession guiding me.

345
00:19:31,350 --> 00:19:36,670
Is this the path to uncover

346
00:19:33,230 --> 00:19:36,670
truths from falsehoods ?

347
00:19:36,950 --> 00:19:42,270
In a world of murk and shadow,

348
00:19:38,850 --> 00:19:42,270
only the flame of truth can light the way.

349
00:19:42,310 --> 00:19:47,990
Look at them all,

350
00:19:45,190 --> 00:19:47,990
being carried by the waves.

351
00:19:48,430 --> 00:19:52,630
Look at them all,

352
00:19:50,590 --> 00:19:52,630
being drowned.

353
00:19:52,710 --> 00:19:55,950
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

354
00:19:55,990 --> 00:19:59,030
I will let the world refine my soul.

355
00:19:59,160 --> 00:20:04,590
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

356
00:20:00,850 --> 00:20:04,590
I will fight.

357
00:20:04,590 --> 00:20:07,710
I'll break through the abyss of despair

358
00:20:07,710 --> 00:20:10,750
to finally learn who I really am.

359
00:20:10,750 --> 00:20:16,110
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

360
00:20:12,630 --> 00:20:16,110
I embrace this obsession.

361
00:20:16,110 --> 00:20:19,070
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

362
00:20:19,070 --> 00:20:21,870
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

363
00:20:21,870 --> 00:20:27,350
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

364
00:20:23,910 --> 00:20:27,350
I'll still fight.

365
00:20:27,550 --> 00:20:30,710
It's hard to avoid loneliness

366
00:20:30,710 --> 00:20:33,750
when you are above everyone else.

367
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:39,430
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

368
00:20:36,070 --> 00:20:39,430
be afraid of a firefly ?
